THAC0: +3
Damage: 1D4+3 (percing)
Speed Factor: 1
Proficiency Type: Dagger
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 3 Strength
 
Weight: 2~

@207 = ~Fairy Orb~
@208 = ~You found this orb in the belly of a giant carrion crawler. It glows with a strange blue light when you hold it in your hand. Strangely, you instinctively know what to do with it.

Equipment capacity:
Protection against 1st to 3rd level spells.

Charge capacity:
Once per day, you can choose to cast:
- Absolute Immunity
- Fairy Shield (immunity to magic for 4 rounds) 
- Fairy Globe of Invulnerability (Immunity to 1st- through 5th-level spells and the rest of the group to 1st- through 3th-level spells)
Special: Must be held in hand, takes the place of the shield.~
@2081 = ~Fairy Shield~
@2082 = ~Fairy Globe of Invulnerability~

@209 = ~Tr'kin's Cruel Sword +5~
@210 = ~This sword is one of two things left behind by the Absolute Evil when it disappeared.

PARAMETERS:

Equipment abilities:
+3 to critical hit chance
+3 to backstab multiplier
+1 attack per round
Special: the sword is inhabited by the relentless spirit of Tr'kin the xvart, and there is a high chance that this will have repercussions on the bearer.
Special: Cursed, it can only be removed with a curse removal spell.

Charge Capacity:
Once per day, allows you to cast a combination of Greater Invisibility and Immunity to Divination.

THAC0: +5
Damage: 2D3 +5 (slashing)
Speed Factor: 0
Proficiency Type: Short sword
Type: One-handed
Requires:
 5 Strength

Weight: 1~

@211 = ~Wonderful Discombulator~
@212 = ~This authentic artifact has been enchanted with only the most refined spatial and temporal spells. Using complex alchemical materials and magical, artisanal iconography, this modern arcane marvel allows its user to exert influence beyond even time and space to find all kinds of mysterious and powerful elixirs, straight from behind the veil of reality itself, without the slightest training. It has never been easier to conjure potions.

PARAMETERS:

Charge capacity:
- Once per day, creates a random potion.~

@213 = ~Wand of Displacement~
@214 = ~Someone was buried with this wand.

PARAMETERS:

Capacity:
- Teleportation (instantaneous)
- Interversion (on target, interverts the user and the target)~
@2141 = ~Teleportation~
@2142 = ~Interversion~

@215 = ~Incarnate Black Blade of Disaster~
@216 = ~This weapon is a living spell that you have managed to subdue. Rather than dying, the spell chose to bend to your will in order to live. It has therefore become a weapon that you can use.

PARAMETERS

Equipment Capacity:
- Sets the wearer's Long Sword Proficiency to 5

Combat Capacity:
- the victim must make a Save vs. Death at +4 or be disintegrated.
- 10% chance with every hit that the sword drains 4 levels from the target and heals the wielder 20 Hit Points.
- 2% chance that the weapon will go Berserk: in this case, it will fly out of the wearer's hand and become an aggressive living spell. Its owner must then subdue it again if they want to retrieve it.

THAC0: +5
Damage: 2D12 +5 (slashing)
Speed Factor: 0 
Proficiency Type: Long Sword
Type: One-handed

Weight: 0~

