@229 = ~Robe of the Lich~
@230 = ~This robe lay among the ashes of a long-extinguished campfire. Someone had clearly tried to burn it for warmth, but it resisted the fire and remains intact.

PARAMETERS:

- Armor Class: 3
- Can memorize three extra spells of each level
- Maximum hit points set at 1 hit point per level
- Immunity to any other effect that would modify maximum hit points~

@231 = ~Mage Slayer~
@232 = ~This sword lay at the bottom of a tomb before you looted it.

PARAMETERS:

Combat Abilities:
- Dispels magic on hit
